id: precedence-global-merge-basic
category: precedence
images: rs-oracle9
targets: rhel9
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: global alphabetic merge regardless of directory: usr/lib/sysctl.d/99-z.conf (rank 3, lowest precedence dir) sorts after etc/sysctl.d/10-a.conf (rank 0) and wins (W03-a). Compliant value 2 in etc is overridden by non-compliant 0 in usr/lib.
